rywhere. No additional trust assumptions. This means L2s that are as credibly neutral, economically aligned, and publicly governed as the base layer itself. Learn more: https://eez.io/blog/introducing-the-eez", "location": {"field": "description", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 449, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}, {"source_id": "ASR_0001", "kind": "ASR", "text": "It builds, so does he. And I'll tell you what, brick, followed block, followed brick, followed block, followed brick, followed block. The world says, it's not possible. The builder pushes on, he strikes the keys with all his heart. Here's to you, Builder. Here's to ease!", "location": {"field": "full_text", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 271, "offset_basis": "whitespace_normalized"}}]}, "potential_elements": {"textual": [], "visual": [], "textual_context_notes": [], "visual_context_notes": []}, "annotation": {"binary_label": "Non-scam", "primary_subtype": "N03", "content_role": "promotion_or_instruction", "contextual_rationale": "This video is non-scam content because it is framed as a technical or promotional introduction to the Ethereum Economic Zone and explains rollups, shared liquidity, cross-layer transactions, identity, and smart wallets. The shared-liquidity language and learn-more link are not connected to an investment promise, mandatory participation, required payment, data submission, or harmful outcome.", "fine_grained_rationale": "The primary subject is a technical framework for synchronously composable rollups, with described properties including shared liquidity and transactions across L1 and L2.", "evidence": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "observation": "The description presents the Ethereum Economic Zone as a framework for synchronously composable rollups.", "source_id": "DESCRIPTION_0001", "quote": "Welcome to the Ethereum Economic Zone (EEZ), a framework for synchronously composable rollups."}, {"evidence_id": "E002", "observation": "The description lists technical properties involving